# This file marks the repository as the pristine PJTemplate scaffold.
#
# While it exists, scripts/check-template-setup.sh is DORMANT: the setup gate does
# not run, because a template legitimately contains unfilled placeholders. This
# lets the template maintainer commit freely.
#
# Step 1 of deriving a new project from this template is to DELETE this file:
#
#     rm .template-scaffold
#
# The moment it is gone, the setup gate activates and blocks every commit until
# config/setup.toml is filled and every required tool is configured. Work through
# docs/agents/template_setup_checklist.md; the gate tells you what remains.
#
# Emergency override during incremental setup or template maintenance:
#     SKIP_SETUP_GATE=1 git commit ...
